    <profile name="Scout" id="0264-4e12-9cb2-5f1e" hidden="false" publicationId="83b2-e602-pubN65537" typeId="72c5eafc-75bf-4ed9-b425-78009f1efe82" typeName="Abilities">
      <characteristics>
        <characteristic name="Description" typeId="21befb24-fc85-4f52-a745-64b2e48f8228">At the start of the first battle round, before the first turn begins, if this unit is not set up in ambush, it can make a Normal Move of up to 9&quot; as if it were your Movement phase. This unit must end that move more than 9&quot; away from any enemy models. If both players have units that can do this, the player who is taking the first turn moves their units first.</characteristic>
      </characteristics>
    </profile>
    <profile name="Acolyte Hybrid" id="42d1-f442-323f-2fcf" hidden="false" page="93" publicationId="83b2-e602-pubN65537" typeId="800f-21d0-4387-c943" typeName="Unit">
