        <profile name="Cult Chimera" id="fc1c-5611-8cb4-d0a5" hidden="false" typeId="b3a8-0452-7436-44d1" typeName="Transport">
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Capacity" typeId="15aa-1916-a38b-d223">Up to 12 BROOD BROTHERS INFANTRY models. Each Brood Brothers Weapons Team takes the space of two other models. Each ASTRA MILITARUM Heavy Weapons Team takes the space of two other models and each OGRYN takes the space of three other models. If, during deployment, this unit is set up in ambush using the Cult Ambush ability, only units with the Cult Ambush ability can be inside when it is set up.</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
