          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="21befb24-fc85-4f52-a745-64b2e48f8228">• The bearer has a 6+ invulnerable save against ranged attacks.
• Each time the bearer&apos;s unit is selected as the target of a charge, if the bearer is not within Engagement Range of any enemy units, subtract 2 from the charge roll.</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
      </profiles>
    </selectionEntry>
