              <characteristics>
                <characteristic name="Description" typeId="21befb24-fc85-4f52-a745-64b2e48f8228">Add 1 to the Leadership characteristic of friendly GENESTEALER CULTS units within 6&quot; of the bearer. In addition, once per battle, at the start of the Fight phase, you can pick a GENESTEALER CULTS INFANTRY model within 3&quot; of the bearer. Add 2 to that model&apos;s Attacks and Strength characteristics until the end of that phase.</characteristic>
