              <characteristics>
                <characteristic name="Description" typeId="21befb24-fc85-4f52-a745-64b2e48f8228">• Each time the bearer is selected to fight, you can re-roll one wound roll when making the bearer&apos;s attacks.
• Each time the bearer has fought, select one enemy model that lost any wounds as a result of an attack made by the bearer&apos;s Magus bio-dagger or Sanctus bio-dagger but was not destroyed. Roll one D6: on a 3+, that model suffers D3 mortal wounds (if it is destroyed, any excess mortal wounds are ignored).</characteristic>
              </characteristics>
            </profile>
          </profiles>
        </selectionEntry>
