                <characteristic name="Abilities" typeId="837d-5e63-aeb7-1410">Each time you select a target for this weapon, you can ignore the Look Out, Sir rule. Each time an attack is made with this weapon, an unmodified wound roll of 4+ inflicts 1 mortal wound on the target in addition to any normal damage.</characteristic>
