              <characteristics>
                <characteristic name="Description" typeId="21befb24-fc85-4f52-a745-64b2e48f8228">Select one genomic enhancement for the bearer to gain (see the Genomic Enhancement ability, page 102), even though it is not a CORE or ABERRANT unit. If your army includes any BIOPHAGUS units, you can instead select two genomic enhancements for the bearer to gain.</characteristic>
