              <characteristics>
                <characteristic name="Description" typeId="21befb24-fc85-4f52-a745-64b2e48f8228">Replace the bearer&apos;s psychic familiar&apos;s ability with the following:
&apos;The Crouchling
• Once per Psychic phase, you can re-roll one Psychic test taken for this model.
• Each time a Psychic test is passed for this model, if all dice results in that test were the same, that psychic power or psychic action cannot be denied.&apos;</characteristic>
              </characteristics>
            </profile>
          </profiles>
        </selectionEntry>
