              <characteristics>
                <characteristic name="Description" typeId="21befb24-fc85-4f52-a745-64b2e48f8228">• The bearer attempt to deny one additional psychic power in your opponent&apos;s Psychic phase.
• While the bearer is on the batltefield, each time it attempts to deny a psychic power, it can do so from any range, instead of within 24&quot;.
• Each time the bearer attempts to manifest a Malediction or Witchfire psychic power, add 1 to that attempt&apos;s Psychic test.</characteristic>
              </characteristics>
            </profile>
          </profiles>
