                  <characteristics>
                    <characteristic name="Description" typeId="21befb24-fc85-4f52-a745-64b2e48f8228">Once per battle round, when you use a Genestealer Cults Strategic Play Stratagem or Battle Tactic Stratagem, if that Stratagem is used on a CULT OF THE FOUR-AMRED EMPEROR unit within 12&quot; of this WARLORD, you can reduce the CP cost of that Stratagem by 1CP (to a minimum of 0CP). Note that the CP cost is only reduced by 1CP for that use of the Stratagem, any future uses of it cost the normal amount of CPs. You can only use this ability on each Stratagem once.</characteristic>
