                  <characteristics>
                    <characteristic name="Description" typeId="21befb24-fc85-4f52-a745-64b2e48f8228">• Each time you take an Unquestioning Loyalty test (pg 88) after a saving throw made for this WARLORD is failed, do not roll the dice: it is automatically passed.
• Each time a saving throw is made for this WARLORD is failed, for the purposes of the Unquestioning Loyalty ability, you can select one other friendly PAUPER PRICES or BROOD BROTHERS model with that ability within 6&quot; of this WARLORD instead of 3&quot;.
