                  <characteristics>
                    <characteristic name="Description" typeId="21befb24-fc85-4f52-a745-64b2e48f8228">• Each time this WARLORD makes a melee attack, an unmodified hit roll of 6 scores 2 additional hits.
• Improve the Armour Penetration characteristic of melee weapons this WARLORD is equipped with by 1 (excluding Relics).</characteristic>
