                <characteristic name="Description" typeId="21befb24-fc85-4f52-a745-64b2e48f8228">The first time this unit is selected to fight in this battle, until that fight is resolved, add 1 to the Attacks characteristic of models in this unit. This is not cumulative with the additional attack granted by the Might From Beyond psychic power (pg 71).</characteristic>
