                <characteristic name="Details" typeId="ad96-dfa4-b4ed-656d">Blessing: Select one friendly PAUPER PRINCES CORE unit within 18&quot; of and visible to this PSYKER. Until the start of your next Psychic phase, each time a model in that unit is destroyed by a melee attack, roll one D6: on a 5+, after the attacking model&apos;s unit has finished making its attacks, it suffers 1 mortal wound ( a unit can suffer a maximum of 5 mortal wounds per phase as a result of this psychic power).</characteristic>
